---
title: "Digital Image Acquisition and Display"
code: "RAD-270"
category: "radiography"
credits: "2"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Includes basic principles of digital radiography, image acquisition, image acquisition errors, software image processing, fundamental principles of exposures, image evaluation, quality assurance and maintenance issues, and digital display. Lecture 1 hour. Laboratory 3 hours. Total 4 hours per week. Additional course fee applies.
